# Copy this file to hf_token.txt and paste your Hugging Face access token
# (read access is enough). Create one: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# You must also accept the license on:
#   https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-86M
#
# One line, no quotes:
# hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Fine-grained token: in https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens under that token,
# enable access to *public gated* repositories (or use a "classic" Read token).
